From f7c9e3ce5e7774ca937b57103246707ad8372b10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] FreeChat: keep messages, drafts and sent history in
 memory only

The sync store is a MemoryStore; the legacy IndexedDB sync store and stored
drafts are deleted at startup. Desktop no longer builds a Seshat search index.
